 plano de tratamento.","fontFamily":"Raleway, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","fontSize":13.125,"lineHeight":22.3125,"letterSpacing":0,"advance":673.45,"loaded":true},{"key":"A empresa Invisalign, fornece alinhadores de reposição a preço de custo.","fontFamily":"Raleway, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","fontSize":13.125,"lineHeight":22.3125,"letterSpacing":0,"advance":441.15,"loaded":true},{"key":"Consulte sempre nosso dentista se precisar de alinhadores Invisalign de reposição.","fontFamily":"Raleway, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"600","fontSize":15.9375,"lineHeight":17.5312,"letterSpacing":0,"advance":624.09,"loaded":true},{"key":"Compartilhe isso:","fontFamily":"Raleway, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"700","fontSize":12,"lineHeight":14.4,"letterSpacing":0,"advance":99.74,"loaded":true},{"key":"Facebook","fontFamily":"\"Open Sans\", sans-serif","fontWeight":"500","fontSize":13,"lineHeight":23,"letterSpacing":0,"advance":57.88,"loaded":true},{"key":"X","fontFamily":"\"Open Sans\", sans-serif","fontWeight":"500","fontSize":13,"lineHeight":23,"letterSpacing":0,"advance":7.51,"loaded":true},{"key":"Relacionado","fontFamily":"Raleway, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"700","fontSize":12,"lineHeight":13.2,"letterSpacing":0,"advance":71.91,"loaded":true},{"key":"Como funciona o tratamento com o Invisalign?","fontFamily":"Raleway, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","fontSize":14,"lineHeight":20,"letterSpacing":0,"advance":300.05,"loaded":true},{"key":"5 de novembro de 2025","fontFamily":"Raleway, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","fontSize":14,"lineHeight":20,"letterSpacing":0,"advance":152.73,"loaded":true},{"key":"Em \"Blog do Dentista\"","fontFamily":"Raleway, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","fontSize":14,"lineHeight":20,"letterSpacing":0,"advance":140.3,"loaded":true},{"key":"Como é o aparelho Invisalign?","fontFamily":"Raleway, Helvetica, Arial, sans-s